Psion S3a: GTLib v1.0 (Freeware)
----------------------------------
A Library for OPL-Programmer with 39
functions (Graphic&Tools): New Menus,
Filerequester, Scrollbars, Text-Edit,
String-Tools, 3D-Print and many more!
Incl. help: english&german doc, dbf,
opo, opl and a macro!
This is a must for every programmer.
